Chapter: ClipArm
  cites WebApp chapter WebRuntime
  cites WebApp chapter WebGpu
  cites Diffusion chapter CheckpointLayout
  cites Diffusion chapter ClipGraph
  cites Diffusion chapter BrowserClip
  cites Diffusion chapter BrowserUNet
